usage: plan.py next [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--json] [--parallel N]
                    plan

semantic next step

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --json
  --parallel N          list up to N lanes that can run side by side across
                        the plan
